[msg MSG_LUI_030_1 speaker 0] // Blond child
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}Kagutsuchi lost its light...
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}by the hand of a demon.
{wait}

[msg MSG_LUI_030_2 speaker 0] // Blond child
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}The world will never be born again.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}Creation is no longer possible.
{wait}

[msg MSG_LUI_040_1 speaker 0] // Blond child
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}Be born,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}grow,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}die,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}...and be born again.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}That was the way of the world.
{wait}

[msg MSG_LUI_050_1 speaker 0] // Blond child
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}One demon has changed that.
{wait}

[msg MSG_LUI_060_1 speaker 1] // Old gentleman in a wheelchair
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}A world is created,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}populated by mankind,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}and destroyed...
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}This cycle is what maintains
the flow of time; when the cycle
stops, so does time.
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}And now, time has met her death.
{wait}

[msg MSG_LUI_060_2 speaker 1] // Old gentleman in a wheelchair
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}In place of the creation of
the new world,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}a new power of darkness emerged...
reigning over chaos,
heaping death upon death.
{wait}

[msg MSG_LUI_070_1 speaker 1] // Old gentleman in a wheelchair
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}You must no longer have
any notion...
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}of where your strength will lead you.
{wait}

[msg MSG_LUI_070_2 speaker 1] // Old gentleman in a wheelchair
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}The Great Will shall curse you
for going against his way,
{wait}
---
{F2 08 FF FF}{lipsync}and place a heavy burden of
atonement on your shoulders,
which you shall bear for all
eternity.
{wait}

[msg MSG_LUI_080_1 speaker 1] // Old gentleman in a wheelchair
{F2 08 FF FF}{speed 6}{lipsync}Fear not,
{wait}

[msg MSG_LUI_080_2 speaker 1] // Old gentleman in a wheelchair
